 'ticket-quality': ... operations._review_ticket_impl(...)`, and the plan lists eval_solver.py as 'Not touched (LLM-leftovers epic)'.","The plan asserts 'the LLM-leftovers epic retires' ticket-quality but names no dependency ordering that removes the spec + dispatch before this story drops the enum member."],"finding":"The plan removes 'ticket-quality' from AGENTIC_SOLVERS but leaves both the packaged ticket-quality.eval.yaml corpus spec and the live eval_solver.py:406 dispatch (operations._review_ticket_impl) in place, so solver_arm('ticket-quality') no longer short-circuits to None and the documented 'provider split silently collapses' bug the exclusion prevents is reintroduced for any ticket-quality corpus item.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f3d8a3701fe0f6787","impact":1.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach: 'provider_parity.py: :88 becomes frozenset({\"completion-verifier\", \"spec-alignment\"})'; AC line 'print(sorted(AGENTIC_SOLVERS))' == ['completion-verifier','spec-alignment']","norm_id":"n681ae344945c75c4","priority":0.9,"reason":"high-priority+criterion-opted-in","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Provider-parity run on a corpus containing the packaged ticket-quality case after this story lands but before the LLM-leftovers epic removes the spec/dispatch.","A ticket-quality solver_id that resolves as a criterion or code-review prompt id, scoring it on an arm where gate_config never reached — a false parity verdict."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Keep 'ticket-quality' in AGENTIC_SOLVERS in this story (it is orthogonal to the corpus-root change) and move its removal into the LLM-leftovers epic that also deletes ticket-quality.eval.yaml and the eval_solver.py:406 dispatch; or add an explicit prerequisite dependency on that epic and update the 'zero behaviour change' claim accordingly.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.9,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"y